# Casa del Ingeniero Teo (C2, contract 31), 10 x 8, interior. column = i, row = j; (0,0) = back corner. Teo, the inventor of the PC box system, sits at his radio console
# with huge headphones and does not hear you (no transformation gag: he is stuck in the loop of his own test broadcast). The big knob on the console (the machine, interact)
# stops the loop: he jumps up, thanks you, hands over the FERRY PASS (a key item, chapter C3) and says his PC is yours. His PC works (native `pc`). Flags 48 teo_knob, 49 teo_helped.
@map casa_teo
@size 10 8
@interior yes
@bg 3
@fill floor_wood
@spawn door 4 6 N
@flag teo_knob 48               # the knob was turned
@flag teo_helped 49             # Teo thanked the player (the pass was given)
@legend
  .  tile=floor_wood
  C  tile=none object=wall_corner
  w  tile=none object=wall_j
  y  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  |  tile=none object=wall_i
  q  tile=none object=wall_win_i
  B  object=bookshelf interact=look text=teo.books
  P  object=pc interact=look script=pc_box
  M  object=machine interact=look script=knob
  V  object=tv interact=look text=teo.tv
  T  object=table
  t  npc=teo id=teo face=SW script=teo
  m  tile=mat
@grid
  Cwywwwywww
  |.B..PM.V.
  |..t.....B
  |.........
  q....T....
  |.........
  |.........
  |...mm....
@warp m -> ruta_25 spawn=cottage_door
# The PC terminal: the box screen of the PC plugin.
@script pc_box interact
    pc
@end
# The console's big knob (the machine): the first time it stops the loop in Teo's headphones; afterwards a remark.
@script knob interact
    jf teo_knob again
    say teo.knob.turn
    setf teo_knob
    npc_face_hero teo
    say teo.knob.react
    end
  again:
    say teo.knob.again
@end
# Teo. Before the knob: he does not hear you. After it: his thanks, the Ferry Pass (a full bag keeps teo_helped clear), his PC speech; afterwards a last line.
@script teo npc
    jf teo_helped done
    jf teo_knob talk
    say teo.deaf
    end
  talk:
    npc_face_hero teo
    say teo.thanks
    give_item ferry_pass 1
    jv 0 0 full
    item_var 0 ferry_pass
    say gl.gift
    setf teo_helped
    say teo.pc
    end
  full:
    say gl.found.full
    end
  done:
    npc_face_hero teo
    say teo.after
@end
